	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You gain tremorsense out to a range of 15 feet. If you spend your turn without moving, your tremorsense extends out to a range of 30 feet. If you use any movement or are forcibly moved (such as being shoved or by the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.65ksar78lxxp7uol]{Thunderwave} spell), your tremorsense reverts back to 15 feet until you spend another turn without moving.</p>",
